secubox-ytsas (0.2.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * FEAT public player page (ytsas.gk2.secubox.in): new www/ytsas/public.html
    — torrent-SAS-styled (cyan hybrid-dark, standalone, no admin chassis)
    add-row (POST /add) + read-only library list (GET /list) + inline
    play (<video>/stream/{id} or an embedded peertube_url) + a safe
    /conserve action. No cookie upload, no remove/purge — those stay
    admin-only. install-lxc.sh now swaps the LXC's served index.html to
    public.html after deploy (keeping the original as admin.html inside the
    LXC), so the LXC's own StaticFiles root ("/") serves the public player
    while the aggregator continues to serve the unmodified admin dashboard
    (www/ytsas/index.html) at admin.gk2/ytsas/ — the two are now fully split.
  * Folds in feat #1056 (endpoint GET /resolve — meilleure source locale
    (mirror PeerTube / cache / pending) pour une URL YouTube + enfilement du
    rapatriement ; ytid.py, extraction canonique du video_id) cherry-picked
    from feature/1056-media-embed-souverain, which had already shipped this
    on the board as 0.2.0-1~bookworm1 before this package existed — this
    0.2.1 supersedes it and carries both changes forward instead of
    regressing the board's /resolve endpoint.

