secubox-ytsas (0.1.1-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * install-lxc: install the deno JS runtime — yt-dlp now REQUIRES one for
    YouTube ("extraction without a JS runtime has been deprecated"); without it
    videos fail "Requested format is not available".
